      "id": "DC_kwDOKrJqmc4A65ph",
      "body": "if you are able to buy one locally and browse the internet with it, it will work to catch stingrays. but we don't have many data points outside of US and EU and can't guarantee it, nor do we know if it's the most cost effective option for oceania. whether it can connect to the internet might also depend on the carrier you're using in that region.",
